{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/a831d4e4d5fa95b6e0e7872d6db01184.avif?t=1769765449\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras_big/a831d4e4d5fa95b6e0e7872d6db01184.avif?t=1769765449 width=800 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/23f3edc19c1fdf7f81494fe6101ac597.poster.avif?t=1769765449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/23f3edc19c1fdf7f81494fe6101ac597.webm?t=1769765449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/23f3edc19c1fdf7f81494fe6101ac597.mp4?t=1769765449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your desktop garden while you work, study, or relax!<br><strong>My Tiny Garden</strong> is a cozy game that runs at the bottom of your screen, turning your desktop into a comfortable little world of plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your screen, customize your garden, and build the calmest corner of your digital life.<br><strong>My Tiny Garden</strong> is the perfect relaxing companion for your daily routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/780a9aaf7bda657a5fd6adb5dc8e8ec7.avif?t=1769765449\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras_big/780a9aaf7bda657a5fd6adb5dc8e8ec7.avif?t=1769765449 width=800 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/08fa474c96b7014947b73ae73365c9b9.poster.avif?t=1769765449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/08fa474c96b7014947b73ae73365c9b9.webm?t=1769765449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719580/extras/08fa474c96b7014947b73ae73365c9b9.mp4?t=1769765449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Take care of your plants</strong>: Water, trim, and add compost to keep them happy and healthy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Earn coins</strong>: Well-cared-for plants will reward you with coins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3c <strong>Unlock new content</strong>: Use coins to buy new types of plants, pots, and stands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf80 <strong>Customize your garden</strong>: Add cute decorations to make your garden unique and cozy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f <strong>Decorate your desktop</strong>: Freely move your plants around and create a charming environment while you use your computer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf38 <strong>Calm and relaxing atmosphere</strong>: Perfect for keeping things peaceful while you work or study.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Cozy Grove","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3719580/18cc32832ce65290da8c80e2528b313f5369fa3b.jpg"},{"name":"A Few Spare Coins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3719580/ac44eadc518bc2f4b6c3cc6db7e538